<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-26T15:20:35.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:20:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have launched missile and drone attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking Riyadh airport and targeting missile facilities and oil infrastructure, while Saudi air defenses intercepted many of the weapons. The Saudi-led coalition responded by destroying Houthi missile tunnels, launchers and storage sites in Yemen. Egypt’s parliament has authorized military support for Saudi Arabia to help defend against the Houthi attacks. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNVEZmNVJCY1VUNEtXLUJrU3Q4cTJkd1NRSUJhOGhVb19VR19EZDZzclZONTNNYl9hLW8wWGpaODBtN2JJcGNTSktTaFp2VC1zSE1ISFk5M25vSEgyakNNSmZiU054YmFTTTBDNUZYY2ZKbjNkaHBJVVJsbmljMC1ocE84U2R5NDNldEtUakw3UHJubGxjb0Y5UWRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Arab Weekly&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPaXZfYjhmN0dKNEk3cUtwVW5LOGUzXzZCS3RtNHJrT3F0eUhDSEplZWl6anB6eWVNTnh1V3lrLTVzc3YyOGpGUlpPSVVIVU5DTVItLVUwaUFZTlR4VENGSUdpU2NfUEZxdGY3LXV4SHN3WkZMcmNfdmpjU0pkZHJzMmFTS0pCZGtXWW5pcEJlMV9ITmFrVGhiN3Zn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo! Finance Canada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTFBjcEU1dG9HMDR3cjhpelU1a3lQMG05WkRvdWFjTVdoQzdvX3FGZmhadVYxRldjMWxVQ1FlbTNHd0kxU21TR2czckV5WWdJbjRuUUV6S0JZd3lVYVVsU254Mm9GVXQzRjNYWVZWYXpjLV9uTUdOT1BiOVNyWjFjUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo News Singapore&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTFBOT1hxN0hwcllNVV9yWkFtdHBFSS1KelU2LXA3Z3VRaWY0OEg0M1pDZ3Z2OEFIaHJzSkRFVTJ0SzNUMjA3em9IbFBHQk9LdXkyeUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yemen Online&lt;/